Unreleased - se7enxweb/expcomponents-signal-slot
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

- Renamed: The package is se7enxweb/expcomponents-signal-slot, the Exponential
  fork of Zeta Components SignalSlot, maintained by 7x (se7en.x) and the
  Exponential Foundation. It replaces zetacomponents/signal-slot, so packages
  that require the upstream name keep working. Class names (ezc*) are
  unchanged.
- Updated: Requirements on other Zeta Components point to their Exponential
  forks (se7enxweb/expcomponents-base), which replace the upstream packages.
- Updated: composer.json states the license (Apache-2.0) and the PHP
  versions; the component is tested on PHP 7.4 to 8.5.
- Added: NOTICE keeps the upstream copyright notices and names the fork;
  README.md describes the fork.
- Added: A GitHub Actions workflow running the test suite on PHP 7.4 to 8.5.


1.2 - Saturday 27 September 2014
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

- Adjusted source headers of Base to Apache license.
- Updated: Moving copyright information to NOTICE files.
- Use assertInstanceOf() instead of assertType(). (tests)
- Remove custom test runner.
- Added composer.json and test dependencies.


